EXPERIMENT 3
Practicing DCL and TCL Commands

AIM
To understand and practice DCL and TCL commands in SQL.

OBJECTIVES
• Learn GRANT and REVOKE commands.
• Understand COMMIT, ROLLBACK and SAVEPOINT.
• Manage transactions effectively.
• Control user access to database objects.

ALGORITHM
1. Create a table and insert sample records.
2. Practice GRANT and REVOKE.
3. Perform UPDATE operations.
4. Create a SAVEPOINT.
5. Use ROLLBACK and COMMIT.
6. Verify the records.

RESULT
DCL permissions and TCL transaction-control commands are demonstrated.

